Subject: [PATCH] clk: novatek: name NA51055 shipped PLL object for Kbuild
Upstream-Status: Pending
License: GPL-2.0-only

Kbuild's shipped-object rule is selected by listing the output .o name. Listing
the .o_shipped input directly drops it from built-in.a and leaves
pll_dump_info unresolved.

--- a/drivers/clk/novatek/Makefile
+++ b/drivers/clk/novatek/Makefile
@@ -9 +9 @@ obj-$(CONFIG_COMMON_CLK_NA51089)	+= nvt-im-clk-fr.o na51089-clk.o nvt-clk-dbg.o na51089/pll.o_shipped
-obj-$(CONFIG_COMMON_CLK_NA51055)	+= nvt-im-clk-fr.o na51055-clk.o nvt-clk-dbg.o na51055/pll.o_shipped
+obj-$(CONFIG_COMMON_CLK_NA51055)	+= nvt-im-clk-fr.o na51055-clk.o nvt-clk-dbg.o na51055/pll.o
